cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kapso in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Kapso: a self-improving software factory for AI and Data objectives"
abstract: >-
  Kapso is a self-improving software factory for AI and Data objectives. Give it an
  objective and it autonomously builds the best solution, deploys it, and learns
  from every run: it keeps what moved the metric, with the evidence that earned
  it, and learns from public repositories and papers.
